PRE-EXISTING BLOCKER FIXED (required to make the solution compile at all)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  At HEAD the solution did NOT build: two independently-merged P2 widget commits both declared
  `public sealed record SystemHealthSnapshot(...)` in the SAME namespace TeslaSync.App.DashboardWidgets:
    - dashboard-widgets/SystemHealthWidget/SystemHealthWidget.Model.cs   (commit bae7b5b15)
    - dashboard-widgets/UptimeMonitorWidget/UptimeMonitorWidget.Model.cs (commit b73820953)
  -> CS0101 (duplicate definition) + CS8863 in BOTH TeslaSync.App.csproj and TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj,
     which also cascaded into WMC0001 XAML errors in ComponentGallery.xaml (the C# assembly never built).
  This is an integration regression unrelated to ResultPanel. Resolved with the smallest, behaviour-
  preserving fix: renamed the SMALLER-footprint occurrence (SystemHealthWidget's record, 16 refs across 2
  files) to `SystemHealthReport`; UptimeMonitorWidget keeps its own `SystemHealthSnapshot`. No behaviour
  change — verified by the green widget suites below (SystemHealthWidget + UptimeMonitorWidget: 140/140).
  Files touched: SystemHealthWidget.Model.cs (5), SystemHealthWidgetTests.cs (11).

